clean-up-permissions-help=This process removes the assignment of some permissions on the Guest, User, and Power User roles in order to simplify the management of <em>User Customizable Pages</em>. Notably, <em>Add To Page</em> permissions is removed from the Guest, and User role for all portlets. Likewise, the same permission is reduced in scope for Power Users from portal wide to scoped to <em>User Personal Site</em>. (Automatic Copy)
